have similar configurations.

We have a Alpha 2100 with a KZPSC 3 channel RAID controller card.  Of
course there is support for it at the console no matter what O/S you are
using.  However, it was reported that this controller was not going to
be supported with Tru64 v5.0 in various DEC publications (mistakenly or
