received my Tru64 kit with 6 CD's, included was part number AI-ROUFK-BE
with CD part number AG-RCFBD-BS... And guess what? There are folders
called ALPHAPC164SX & ALPHAPC164LX. Gee, if 164SX & 164LX owners weren�t
supported, then why were these new SRM firmware images created for these
half-flash machines to replace AlphaBIOS?!

