Dear managers,

the problem with the clonefset (performance issues) and the
incorrect reporting by df of the mounted clone_fsets has been
fixed with a new advfs.mod in /sys/BINARY issued by DEC.

This fixes the forementioned problem introduced by the
BL2 (patchkit #2) on 4.0e and most propably on 4.0d pkit #5.

I haven't checked if DEC has posted it on their ftp site,
though I'm sure it should be available by request.

