Sorry for the lateness of the summary.

Thanks to the following for responding:
Ann Cantelow <cantelow@athena.csdco.com>
John P Speno <speno@isc.upenn.edu>
Donn Aiken <daiken@regents.edu>
Michael Bucholtz <mbucholt@ceiss.org>
